{"1635520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dust Devil", "steam_appid": 1635520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUST DEVIL</h2>Super hardcore coffee-break arcade.<br><br><br>In the middle of street riots, you dodge motor officers, lasers, orbital beams and break cell mufflers on your hyper bike. The game is super fast and difficult: it has time limit and just a few checkpoints on your way to boss fights. With just one mouse button you control a swarm of bikers or a single agile rider. Your skills and tactics are that matters on each level.<br><br>No grind, no character progression, just never stopping action.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready, Steady, Go!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 minutes to (beat the game) overthrow the government<br></li><li>Minimalistic controls<br></li><li>14 levels from street riots to corporate rooftops<br></li><li>2 boss fights, no hitpoints<br></li><li>Drift and outmaneuver riot cops<br></li><li>Pick up duplicators to make bike swarms<br></li><li>Brutal New Game +</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUST DEVIL</h2>Super hardcore coffee-break arcade.<br><br><br>In the middle of street riots, you dodge motor officers, lasers, orbital beams and break cell mufflers on your hyper bike. The game is super fast and difficult: it has time limit and just a few checkpoints on your way to boss fights. With just one mouse button you control a swarm of bikers or a single agile rider. Your skills and tactics are that matters on each level.<br><br>No grind, no character progression, just never stopping action.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready, Steady, Go!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 minutes to (beat the game) overthrow the government<br></li><li>Minimalistic controls<br></li><li>14 levels from street riots to corporate rooftops<br></li><li>2 boss fights, no hitpoints<br></li><li>Drift and outmaneuver riot cops<br></li><li>Pick up duplicators to make bike swarms<br></li><li>Brutal New Game +</li></ul>", "short_description": "Dust Devil is a coffee-break super hardcore minigame. With only one mouse button and your hyper bike you will overthrow a corrupt regime! Race from town squares to skyscraper rooftops in under 5 minutes. Help people on the streets and outspeed riot cops. Catch Prime Minister before he runs away!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635520/header.jpg?t=1677712672", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635520/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1677712672", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635520/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1677712672", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 965<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Toster12D3", "Wolfus", "ErCh"], "publishers": ["A Game From Low Polystan"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 399, "final": 399, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$3.99"}, "packages": [580783], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Dust Devil", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0,